  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining CAD Viewer Structure**\n\nI\'m now architecting the CAD viewer application within `src/`, starting with the essential components and modules. The focus is on defining the foundational types, beginning with `src/types/cad.ts`. This involves specifying entity definitions like Line, Polyline, Circle, Arc, Ellipse, Text, Insert/Block, and Raster Preview. Also, there\'s the layer structure to consider.\n\n\n**Refining Rendering Details**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics. I\'m focusing on extents, render batches (Float32Array for mobile rendering performance), measurements, snap points, and the overall drawing model. Additionally, I\'m working on color palettes (ACI, TrueColor parsing), text sanitization (EUC-KR/UTF-8 fallback, AutoCAD escape code handling), and a robust DXF parser with full entity parsing (including complex elements like SPLINE and nested INSERTs). I have also included OCS to WCS transformations.\n\n\n**Implementing Offline Capabilities**\n\nI\'m now integrating offline functionalities. I\'ve built the LibreDWG WebAssembly loader with multi-CDN fallback, alongside safe AutoCAD DWG parsing (AC1012-AC1032), with thumbnail preview extraction as a backup. I\'m also including a normalizer for LibreDWG data to `DrawingModel`. For offline access, I\'ve implemented IndexedDB storage in `drawingStorage.ts`. Finally, I\'m generating standalone HTML viewers with and without embedded drawings, including GitHub Pages setup and PWA/APK generation guidance, all via `standaloneExport.ts`.\n\n\n**Adding Interactive Canvas Features**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the interactive features. I\'ve built the `CADCanvas.tsx` component to manage hardware-accelerated rendering at 60fps using `requestAnimationFrame`. This component handles touch gestures like panning and pinch-zooming, along with mouse wheel zooming and dragging. I\'ve also implemented OSNAP for precision, including End point, Mid point, and Center point snapping, with a touch loupe for enhanced mobile interaction. I\'ve included dynamic grid rendering, a real-time coordinates HUD, and selected entity highlighting and measurement line rendering. I\'ve also implemented a responsive minimap for viewport visualization and a header with essential controls.\n\n\n**Designing UI Components**\n\nI\'ve integrated the deploy button and designed key UI elements. This includes an auto-calibrating universal mode bar with theme switchers and text scaling. I\'ve also implemented a touch-friendly bottom dock with action buttons, a comprehensive layer management modal, a two-point scale calibration dialog, and a samples modal with built-in drawings.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1603467"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * @license\\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\\n */\\n\\nexport type CadTheme = \'white\' | \'dark\' | \'blueprint\';\\nexport type ToolMode = \'pan\' | \'select\' | \'measure\' | \'calibrate\';\\n\\nexport interface Point2D {\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Vertex2D extends Point2D {\\n  bulge?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface Extents2D {\\n  minX: number;\\n  minY: number;\\n  maxX: number;\\n  maxY: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LayerInfo {\\n  name: string;\\n  aci: number;\\n  color: string;\\n  visible: boolean;\\n  count: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CadEntityBase {\\n  id: string;\\n  type: string;\\n  layer: string;\\n  aci?: number | null;\\n  linetype?: string;\\n  lineweight?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LineEntity extends CadEntityBase {\\n  type: \'LINE\';\\n  start: Point2D;\\n  end: Point2D;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface PolylineEntity extends CadEntityBase {\\n  type: \'LWPOLYLINE\';\\n  vertices: Vertex2D[];\\n  closed?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CircleEntity extends CadEntityBase {\\n  type: \'CIRCLE\';\\n  center: Point2D;\\n  radius: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ArcEntity extends CadEntityBase {\\n  type: \'ARC\';\\n  center: Point2D;\\n  radius: number;\\n  startAngle: number;\\n  endAngle: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface EllipseEntity extends CadEntityBase {\\n  type: \'ELLIPSE\';\\n  center: Point2D;\\n  majorAxis: Point2D;\\n  axisRatio: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TextEntity extends CadEntityBase {\\n  type: \'TEXT\';\\n  position: Point2D;\\n  height: number;\\n  rotation?: number;\\n  text: string;\\n  align?: CanvasTextAlign;\\n  isMtext?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface InsertEntity extends CadEntityBase {\\n  type: \'INSERT\';\\n  blockName: string;\\n  position: Point2D;\\n  scaleX?: number;\\n  scaleY?: number;\\n  rotation?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface RasterPreviewEntity extends CadEntityBase {\\n  type: \'RASTER_PREVIEW\';\\n  img: HTMLImageElement;\\n  minX: number;\\n  minY: number;\\n  maxX: number;\\n  maxY: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport type CadEntity =\\n  | LineEntity\\n  | PolylineEntity\\n  | CircleEntity\\n  | ArcEntity\\n  | EllipseEntity\\n  | TextEntity\\n  | InsertEntity\\n  | RasterPreviewEntity;\\n\\nexport interface CadBlock {\\n  name: string;\\n  basePoint: Point2D;\\n  entities: CadEntity[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DrawingModel {\\n  fileName: string;\\n  formatVersion: string;\\n  layers: Record<string, LayerInfo>;\\n  blocks: Record<string, CadBlock>;\\n  entities: CadEntity[];\\n  extents?: Extents2D;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface RenderBatch {\\n  layer: string;\\n  color: string;\\n  dashType: \'S\' | \'D\' | \'C\'; // Solid, Dashed, Center\\n  lineCoords: Float32Array;\\n  polylines: PolylineEntity[];\\n  circles: CircleEntity[];\\n  arcs: ArcEntity[];\\n  ellipses: EllipseEntity[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface MeasurementItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  p1: Point2D;\\n  p2: Point2D;\\n  label: string;\\n  distanceMm: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SnapPoint {\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n  type: \'END\' | \'MID\' | \'CEN\';\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create CAD types definition file\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/cad.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing cad.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create CAD type definitions\"}"
