  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Scale Modal**\n\nI\'m now building the `ScaleModal.tsx` component. The aim is to handle two-point scale calibration. I envision a modal appearing when a user selects two points with a defined dimension, such as a door width or grid size. The modal will accept the real-world dimension in mm and then update the internal model accordingly.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
