  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Recent Drawings**\n\nI\'m working on updating `CADCanvas.tsx`. My current focus is implementing `useImperativeHandle` and displaying recent drawings when the canvas is empty. If the `recentDrawings` array has any entries, I\'ll show a dedicated section to display them.\n\n\n**Refining the UI for Recent Drawings**\n\nI\'ve been refining the UI for displaying recent drawings. I\'m focusing on the condition where the `recentDrawings` array has elements. I\'m implementing a dedicated section with a title, a button to view all drawings, and a horizontally scrolling display of the most recent four items. It\'s designed for a concise and usable display, with a \"View All\" button.\n\n\n**Applying New Rendering Updates**\n\nI\'m now applying specific edits to render thumbnail previews, filenames, and timestamps for recent drawings within `CADCanvas.tsx`. Each preview will include a thumbnail image or a \"\353\257\270\353\246\254\353\263\264\352\270\260\" placeholder, along with the filename and a formatted relative timestamp. I am also wrapping each item in a `div` element to provide formatting.\n\n\n"
