  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Open Mechanism**\n\nI\'ve decided to refine how we open files in `Header.tsx`. Instead of directly triggering the file picker or modal from the \"\353\217\204\353\251\264 \354\227\264\352\270\260\" button, I\'m leaning towards providing an `onOpenSelectModal` function. This would let the button open the `FileSelectModal` seamlessly.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
