  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing App Imports**\n\nOkay, I\'m currently focusing on the import statements within `App.tsx`. I\'ve added `CADCanvasHandle` to access the canvas, and I\'ve replaced `SamplesModal` with `FileSelectModal`. Also, I\'m bringing in `RecentDrawingItem`, along with functions to handle recent drawing persistence.\n\n\n**Implementing Recent Drawings**\n\nI\'ve integrated the recent drawings persistence, loading and deleting functions. I\'ve also added state for `recentDrawings`, `isSelectModalOpen`, and `canvasRef`. I\'m populating the `recentDrawings` state on mount using `getRecentDrawings()`. I\'m working on canvas view capture after applying a drawing model, triggering a thumbnail capture and saving the recent drawing details, and refreshing the state. I\'ve wired up `handleSelectRecent()` to load drawings, with fallbacks for missing drawings. I am addressing the file upload interaction.\n\n\n"
