  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Google Drive Access**\n\nI\'m making a key update in `CloudStorageExplorer.tsx`. I\'m going to refine the `googleUser` type to `GoogleAuthUser | null` from `../lib/googleDrive`. Also, I\'m integrating a `googleShareUrl` state to manage the Google Drive direct link input. This should streamline user sharing workflows.\n\n\n**Implementing Google Token Input**\n\nI\'m adding two new state variables, `googleTokenInput` for manual token entry and `showGoogleTokenInput` to control the visibility of the input field. I\'ve also built handlers for `handleOpenGoogleSharedLink` which validates and processes the `googleShareUrl`, downloading from Google Drive if valid, and `handleConnectGoogleToken` to manage the process with the new token input. Error handling and user feedback through toasts are included in both, with loading state updates.\n\n\n"
