      text: "Fix the errors in the app\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nfix_it_trigger: manual\nerror 0: Google Drive sign-in error: FirebaseError: Firebase: Error (auth/network-request-failed).\n    at createErrorInternal (https://ais-dev-p55zubkq37ae52rlsf5zht-920363950371.asia-east1.run.app/node_modules/.vite/deps/firebase_auth.js?v=bab002e0:435:35)\n    at _fail (https://ais-dev-p55zubkq37ae52rlsf5zht-920363950371.asia-east1.run.app/node_modules/.vite/deps/firebase_auth.js?v=bab002e0:408:8)\n    at _performFetchWithErrorHandling (https://ais-dev-p55zubkq37ae52rlsf5zht-920363950371.asia-east1.run.app/node_modules/.vite/deps/firebase_auth.js?v=bab002e0:765:3)\n    at async _performSignInRequest (https://ais-dev-p55zubkq37ae52rlsf5zht-920363950371.asia-east1.run.app/node_modules/.vite/deps/firebase_auth.js?v=bab002e0:769:25)\n    at async _signInWithCredential (https://ais-dev-p55zubkq37ae52rlsf5zht-920363950371.asia-east1.run.app/node_modules/.vite/deps/firebase_auth.js?v=bab002e0:4770:19)\n    at async PopupOperation.onAuthEvent (https://ais-dev-p55zubkq37ae52rlsf5zht-920363950371.asia-east1.run.app/node_modules/.vite/deps/firebase_auth.js?v=bab002e0:7861:17)\nerror 1: Google sign in error: FirebaseError: Firebase: Error (auth/network-request-failed).\n    at createErrorInternal (https://ais-dev-p55zubkq37ae52rlsf5zht-920363950371.asia-east1.run.app/node_modules/.vite/deps/firebase_auth.js?v=bab002e0:435:35)\n    at _fail (https://ais-dev-p55zubkq37ae52rlsf5zht-920363950371.asia-east1.run.app/node_modules/.vite/deps/firebase_auth.js?v=bab002e0:408:8)\n    at _performFetchWithErrorHandling (https://ais-dev-p55zubkq37ae52rlsf5zht-920363950371.asia-east1.run.app/node_modules/.vite/deps/firebase_auth.js?v=bab002e0:765:3)\n    at async _performSignInRequest (https://ais-dev-p55zubkq37ae52rlsf5zht-920363950371.asia-east1.run.app/node_modules/.vite/deps/firebase_auth.js?v=bab002e0:769:25)\n    at async _signInWithCredential (https://ais-dev-p55zubkq37ae52rlsf5zht-92036395