  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Pan Interactions**\n\nI\'ve been examining the panning interaction within `CADCanvas.tsx`, specifically how `dx` and `dy` are calculated when `isDraggingRef.current` and `mode` are set to \'pan\'. The current rotation value seems relevant within the `pan` mode but I\'m trying to unpack why the subtraction is working as is and how it impacts the other calculations.\n\n\n**Deciphering Coordinate Updates**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implications of how `onUpdateCamera` modifies the camera\'s x and y coordinates, particularly focusing on the `useEffect` hook. I\'m scrutinizing how the camera values, specifically `camX`, `camY`, `zoom`, and `rotation` are being fed into the render loop. I\'m aiming to understand how these updates cascade through the application.\n\n\n"
