    thinking: "**Analyzing Canvas Contexts**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the double-buffer copy process, specifically from lines 935 to 976. I\'m examining the `onScreenCtx` and its configuration. The goal is to ensure a flicker-free atomic copy from the offscreen canvas to the visible canvas. The code uses `getContext(\'2d\', { alpha: false })`.\n\n\n**Refining Atomic Copy**\n\nI\'ve been looking closely at the `requestRender` and `useEffect` hooks. The goal is to optimize the double-buffering. I\'m focusing on the `isDirtyRef.current` flag and how it influences the `requestRender` function call. I need to fully understand its role in coalescing renders to VSYNC, ensuring efficiency.\n\n\n"
