inting (0, 0) Significance**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on transformation matrices and their effect on entities within blocks. It\'s becoming very clear that lines within blocks whose endpoints coincide with the block\'s base point or origin can produce misleading results post-transformation. Now I\'m focused on the implications of a line originating from a machine part that connects to (0, 0). I\'m confident that this is a key component of understanding the white lines.\n\n\n"
