  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Examining Manifest Requirements**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the Web App Manifest and browser installability. The key is ensuring a static `manifest.json` or `manifest.webmanifest` file resides in the `public` directory. I also need to correctly reference this manifest file within the `<head>` section of `index.html` using a `<link>` tag.\n\n\n**Constructing Manifest Files**\n\nI\'m now generating both `manifest.json` and `manifest.webmanifest` files within the `public` directory. I\'m focusing on the required content, including `id`, `name`, `short_name`, `description`, `theme_color`, `background_color`, `display`, `start_url`, and `scope`. I\'m also ensuring the correct icon configuration for `pwa-192x192.png`, `pwa-512x512.png`, and `pwa-maskable-512x512.png`. The `purpose` property is also being set correctly for each icon.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_8492846204745168785"
