  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Artifacts\' Origin**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed an issue with `isArtifactStreakSegment`. It was erroneously discarding valid lines, especially diagonal ones in the CAD domain, due to restrictive length criteria. My initial length thresholds of 500 and 1200 respectively for diagonals and non-axis-aligned lines were clearly too low. Think: machine frames, conveyor sections, hoppers, piping, and other title block divisions. These can have lengths higher than the current constraints.\n\n\n"
